    "subtitle": "Benchmarking frontier LLM agents on real scientific research workflows. Each task ships a Dockerized scientific problem; agents must produce three deliverables — executable code, a results table, and a short report with a machine-readable answer.json — scored on two axes: programmatic execution and LLM-judge presentation.",
